1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:06,265
M: After searching for weeks, I'm so relieved to say that we have finally found a person to take over John's position.

2
00:00:06,725 --> 00:00:08,065
His name is Henry Chow.

3
00:00:08,570 --> 00:00:11,165
W: You see, I told you not to worry too much about it.

4
00:00:11,645 --> 00:00:14,925
I knew it was only a matter of time before we found someone.

5
00:00:15,430 --> 00:00:17,845
Anyway, where did you ever find this guy?

6
00:00:18,505 --> 00:00:22,755
M: Well, we took out ads in the local paper and on Internet sites without much luck.

7
00:00:23,240 --> 00:00:26,205
We even contacted several job agencies but got nothing.

8
00:00:26,925 --> 00:00:29,965
But to our surprise, we found this guy from one of our branch offices.

9
00:00:30,840 --> 00:00:36,185
Mr. Taylor went to see Ms. Simpson in our North Town branch office and saw Henry and liked him right away.

10
00:00:36,990 --> 00:00:41,025
After talking with him for several minutes, he decided to hire him right there and then.

11
00:00:41,805 --> 00:00:43,805
Anyway, he is going to start next Monday.

12
00:00:44,190 --> 00:00:45,985
W: Wow, that's quite a story.

13
00:00:46,565 --> 00:00:47,685
I can't wait to meet him.
